Dear list,

a new version of adegenet (1.1-2) has been uploaded on CRAN today, and 
should be available within 1-2 days (depending on your platform). This 
version corrects a few bugs and adds some new stuff, like improved 
checking of genind/genpop objects, and the function 'propShared' to 
